# Section 7 image pin file — nonsecret, review-only template.
#
# Copy this to `images.env` (outside Git) and fill in the real GHCR digests.
# deploy.sh REFUSES any value that is not an immutable `image@sha256:…` digest,
# so a mutable tag (e.g. `:latest`) cannot accidentally become a production pin.
#
# The real application image references are not yet available and must not be
# invented. Leave these unset until the application publishes them.
WEB_IMAGE=
API_IMAGE=
